

To join the Stacks Builder Challenges, you must:

Connect a Stacks-compatible wallet to your Talent Protocol account.

Connect your GitHub profile, so your open-source contributions can be tracked.

From December 8 onward, Talent Protocol automatically tracks your Stacks on-chain activity + GitHub work as part of your builder score.

Once connected, you appear in the Stacks leaderboard, where rankings update daily based on measurable “builder impact.”
